#: data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:342
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Text_SavingMyProgress"
msgid ""
"I want to take a rest, so I'm saving my\n"
"progress.$"
msgstr ""
"我想休息一下，\n"
"所以先把冒险进度记录下来。$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:346
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Text_IWorkAtPokemonMart"
msgid ""
"Hi!\n"
"I work at a POKéMON MART.\p"
"Can I get you to come with me?$"
msgstr ""
"你好！\n"
"我在友好商店工作。\p"
"可以请你跟我来一下吗？$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:351
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Text_ThisIsAPokemonMart"
msgid ""
"This is a POKéMON MART.\n"
"Just look for our blue roof.\p"
"We sell a variety of goods including\n"
"POKé BALLS for catching POKéMON.\p"
"Here, I'd like you to have this as\n"
"a promotional item.$"
msgstr ""
"这里就是友好商店。\n"
"认准蓝色的屋顶就对了。\p"
"我们出售各种各样的商品，\n"
"包括用来捉宝可梦的精灵球。\p"
"来，这个是促销赠品，\n"
"请收下吧。$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:359
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Text_PotionExplanation"
msgid ""
"A POTION can be used anytime, so it's\n"
"even more useful than a POKéMON CENTER\l"
"in certain situations.$"
msgstr ""
"伤药随时都可以使用，\n"
"所以在某些情况下，\l"
"甚至比宝可梦中心还要方便哦。$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:364
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Text_WaitDontComeInHere"
msgid ""
"Aaaaah! Wait!\n"
"Please don't come in here.\p"
"I just discovered the footprints of\n"
"a rare POKéMON!\p"
"Wait until I finish sketching\n"
"them, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"啊啊啊啊！等一下！\n"
"请不要过来。\p"
"我刚刚发现了\n"
"稀有宝可梦的脚印！\p"
"等我把它画下来，\n"
"好吗？$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:372
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Text_DiscoveredFootprints"
msgid ""
"I just discovered the footprints of\n"
"a rare POKéMON!\p"
"Wait until I finish sketching\n"
"them, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"我刚刚发现了\n"
"稀有宝可梦的脚印！\p"
"等我把它画下来，\n"
"好吗？$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:378
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Text_FinishedSketchingFootprints"
msgid ""
"I finished sketching the footprints of\n"
"a rare POKéMON.\p"
"But it turns out they were only my\n"
"own footprints…$"
msgstr ""
"我把稀有宝可梦的脚印\n"
"画下来了。\p"
"可是后来才发现，\n"
"那原来是我自己的脚印……$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:384
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Text_MayLetsGoBack"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Over here!\l"
"Let's hurry home!$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"这边这边！\l"
"我们快回去吧！$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:389
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Text_BrendanLetsGoBack"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: I'm heading back to my dad's\n"
"LAB now.\l"
"{PLAYER}, you should hustle back, too.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：我现在要回我爸爸的\n"
"研究所了。\l"
"{PLAYER}，你也赶快回去吧。$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown/scripts.inc:394
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Text_TownSign"
msgid ""
"OLDALE TOWN\n"
"“Where things start off scarce.”$"
msgstr ""
"古辰镇\n"
"“一切从零开始的小镇”$"
